      "summary": "Evidence summary: 5 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "progression",
          "statement": "The job system is the central recurring strength and trade-off: players value being able to change classes freely and experiment with party roles, while the number of jobs and the need to develop them can also create grind or decision overload.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
